Package: mapycusmaximus
Title: Applies Focus–Glue–Context Fisheye Transformations for Spatial Visualization
Version: 0.0.0.1092
Authors@R: 
    person("Alex", "Nguyen", , "thanhcuong10091992@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to apply focus-glue-context (FGC) fisheye transformations to two-dimensional coordinates and spatial vector geometries. Implements a smooth radial distortion that enlarges a focal region, transitions through a glue ring, and preserves outside context.
